        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>'E's a stupid clod dat won' take no fer an'answa. Now, I know Imma looker, an' I like to 'ave sum fun wit' d' boys, but by d' sea - I got standar's! 'E jus' thinkin' 'e can come up'ta me an' be like: "Hey, gurl, nice ta meet ye. I'm D' Banga."&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
