        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>An' 'e den go, like: "Imma jettin' master o' flingin', I wanna show ye a coupla tricks..." Dumbat ain' got no style, no taste, no nuthin' an' 'e come up'ta *me* wit' dese dryfoot lines an' thinkin' 'e's gunna git sum? All 'e does is go on 'about 'is bladeslickin' flingin'.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
