    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>So I blew 'im off - off! - an' I tol' 'im to go sniff 'is own rancid farts - I got standar's, $(#mate/sis), an' I got no patience wit' dumbats like 'im - an' 'e left. I thought da's d' en': No way, jette! 'E den come again - an' I 'ad jus' start'd doin' d' cookin' an' all dat crap - an' 'e preten'in' like nuthin' ever happ'n, yo. 'E's like, "Fer real?" An' I'm like also, "Fer real"?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
