        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>An' it wen' on an' on an' on an' on, so I put 'im a little sumthin' in 'is food to show 'im I mean it, but d' banga digests like dem vulture bats! I den put a big sumthin' - an' 'e felt it, 'e sure did - but dat still didn' stop 'im! So I wen' to Cruzer, tol' 'im Flinga wuz a pain in d' ass, an' 'e tol' me to deal wit' it an' stop buggin' 'im, but after I convinced 'im wit' extra-tasty sumthin' - not a "little" sumthin' like wit' Flinga cuz he'd bash me face in - e' tol' me alright, 'e'll deal wit' it, an' den Flinga stopp'd bein' a pain in d' ass - but only fer a while!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
