        <source>An' besides, dere ain' nuthin' wron' wit' bein' a cook. I'm d' bes' cook in D' Pirate Bay, ye hear. Me sautéed siphoner legs makes dem bangas salivate more dan me very own thighs, ha-ha.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a55" name="=&gt;a55">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">110</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You know, um, there are all these men and women living together...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q56" name="=&gt;q56">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">112</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Listen, sis, lemme give ye sum advice. 'Ere, us girls gitta pick who we bang wit', not d' boys. Sum banga touch ye without consent an' Cruzer's gunna blunt-force castrate 'im wit' 'is sledge in no time. We got rules 'round 'ere. Dere are lotsa floozies - like dat hoe Senda - who might tell ye all sorta crap 'bout dis an' dat, but ye listen to me advice an' yer jettin'. Ye gitta pick, dig?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q57" name="=&gt;q57">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">114</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Wit' dat said, bangin' sure is a jettin' way to relieve stress, gotta tell ye. Find me one pirate who's gonna get frustrated when dere ain' nuthin' to loot when dere's *this*... ::She points to herself.:: and *dat*... ::She points to the room behind her.:: walkin' about. I'm talkin' 'bout Choppy, not d' dead siphoner. ::She laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q58" name="=&gt;q58">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">116</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Listen, *banga*, if yer thinkin' wha'a think yer thinkin', den ye gotta know sum rules 'round 'ere. *We* gitta pick who we bang wit', not ye. Ye touch a sis without 'er consent an' Cruzer's gunna blunt-force castrate ye wit' 'is sledge in no time. We got rules 'ere. Sure, dere are lotsa floozies 'round 'ere, but ye step over d' line... yea.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
